sequenceDiagram
    title Product Search with Filters

    actor User
    participant Search as Search API
    participant DB as Products DB
    participant Cache as Redis Cache

    User->>Search: GET /products?q=phone&cat=electronics&sort=price
    activate Search
    Search->>Cache: get("search:phone:electronics")
    activate Cache
    alt cache hit
        Cache-->>Search: cached results
    else cache miss
        Search->>DB: query(q, category, sort)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Search: results[0..20]
        deactivate DB
        Search->>Cache: set("search:phone:electronics", results, TTL=300)
    end
    deactivate Cache

    Search->>Search: enrichWithRatings()
    Note over Search: Fetch ratings from<br/>review service for<br/>each product

    Search->>Search: applyPagination(page=1, size=20)
    Search-->>User: 200 OK {products, total, page}
    deactivate Search
